This is a modified version of the shell of Vyntaris (https://github.com/vyntaris/vyntaris), which is free software
under the GNU General Public License, version 3 or any later version. It was modified in 2026 by exotic-erox:

  - the operating-system parts were removed (installer image, boot splash, login screen, backups, driver and update
    management, the phone link, the password manager, game mode), and it was renamed Eroxis Shell
  - the colors were changed to a black-and-white palette; the wallpapers and the emblem were replaced
  - an installer for existing Arch-based systems was added, and a way to install it next to another setup with tapes
  - added: workspaces beyond nine, a settings page for the keyboard shortcuts, control center options, a fuller About
    page, theme support for KDE applications, and a system summary for terminals

Third-party components and their licenses are listed in THIRD-PARTY.md.
